/T (The dataset provided by Dr. Yazid Al-Zaidi for the Engineering Statistics course was used in this study. This data represents 5,000 products in a factory, which are affected by factors such as temperature, speed, pressure, and minimum production time. Quality is the main focus, as it reflects the final product and shows how temperature, pressure, production time, and speed can affect the product either positively or negatively. The dataset was provided to the group in a ready-to-analyze format and will be used for statistical analysis and to draw meaningful conclusions.)
